---
// Omnifood: a slowly turning plate with leaves and tomatoes.
---

<span class="plate">
  <i class="leaf" style="left:16px;top:22px"></i>
  <i class="leaf" style="left:40px;top:44px;transform:rotate(60deg)"></i>
  <i class="tom" style="left:44px;top:18px"></i>
  <i class="tom" style="left:20px;top:46px"></i>
</span>

<style>
  .plate {
    left: 60px;
    top: 30px;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--pf);
    animation: spin 8s linear infinite;
  }
  .leaf {
    width: 22px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 0 12px 0 12px;
    background: #8fb77c;
  }
  .tom {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e98a6b;
  }
</style>
